<title>AUSTRALIA: Acacia says has 19.99 pct of Helix.</title>
<headline>Acacia says has 19.99 pct of Helix.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Major gold producer Acacia Resources Ltd had lifted its stake in junior Gawler Craton explorer Helix Resources Ltd to just under 20 percent but was not considering going further at this stage, a company spokesman said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Not at this stage, because if we went above 20 percent, it would be a compulsory takeover situation and that is not something we are contemplating at the moment,&quot; Acacia corporate development manager Allan Brash told Reuters.</p>
